    "description": "Welcome to the new MGM Casino Experience - the ultimate Vegas Casino experience! Bringing you the most exciting shows of Vegas and the ONLY live slots tournament app!\r\n\r\nThe Official MGM Partner, MGM Slots Live presents the biggest Live 3D Shows, Tournaments, and Casino Games. The only app to offer the greatest Las Vegas shows and free slot games in genuine MGM Casinos. We bring the excitement of Vegas Casinos straight to your phone ! Wherever you are in the world, experience the energy of a genuine MGM Resort Casino surrounded by action, mega slot variety, jackpots, and thousands of other players. Enter the casino now to spin and collect big rewards! \r\n\r\nReasons to play MGM Slots Live - Free 3D Casino Slot Games:\r\n\r\n\u25cf\tOfficial MGM Partners, featuring MGM Grand, Bellagio, Luxor, Mandalay Bay, Mirage, Aria, and more.\r\n\u25cf\tHuge Variety with all your favorite MGM Casino Slots and Shows, including \u2018Back to Emerald City\u2019, \u2018Cleopatra\u2019, \u2018WinZone\u2019, \u2018Bingo Hit\u2019, \u2018Fired Up 777\u2019, \u2018Wild Trip in Wonderland\u2019 and many more of your favorite free slot machine games.\r\n\u25cf\tExclusive Live Online Casino Slot Tournaments that you can\u2019t discover anywhere else.\r\n\u25cf\tNew Games and New Shows added all the time to make your free slots casino games experience even better.\r\n\u25cf\tWin Big. Spin and play to get huge daily jackpots and bonuses.\r\n\u25cf\tReal Rewards. Play for free to collect loyalty points and redeem them for real rewards, prizes, and surprises to use in real-life.\r\n\u25cf\tExperience the Real Las Vegas. Play online games in real MGM Casinos on the Vegas Strip including the MGM Grand, Luxor, Mandalay Bay, Mirage, and Bellagio.\r\n\u25cf\tGet Social. Live Casino Tournaments playing directly against over 30 players. Invite and play with your friends.\r\n\u25cf\tBackstage Access lets you arrive in glamorous style for the biggest real casino Vegas shows.\r\n