ation (\u201cISGA\u201d) and has adopted its \u201cBest Practice Principles.\u201d See more about the ISGA at www.i-sga.org. For information, guidance, tips, and advice on social gaming, visit \u201cSmart Social Gamers\u201d at www.smartsocialgamers.org.",
